<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets 700 million Ffr fungible bond.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets 700 million Ffr fungible bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDINGS PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p> AMT    700 MLN FFR   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    02.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.00    PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    102.05    SPREAD	+48 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON JUNE 3</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
